# VIP Se Die Integration Guide

## Document Control
| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Version | 1.0 |
| Last Updated | [Current Date] |
| Document Owner | Technical Team |

## Executive Summary

This document provides comprehensive instructions for integrating VIP Se Die (GameId: 22) into projects with existing Se Die (GameId: 2) implementation. VIP Se Die is an enhanced variant of the Se Die game with specific configurations, styling, and premium features.

## 1. Prerequisites

- [ ] Existing Se Die implementation
- [ ] Access to project codebase
- [ ] Required assets and configurations

## 2. Implementation Guide

### 2.1 Configuration Setup

#### 2.1.1 Game Settings Configuration
Required changes in game-settings.json:

```json
{
    "22": {
        "id": 22,
        "gameName": "VipSeDie",
        "name": "VipSeDie",
        "namespaces": ["VipSeDie"],
        "isVisible": true,
        "durations": {
            "wholeRound": 39,
            "lockingBet": 5,
            "placingBet": 30,
            "generatingResult": 1,
            "showingResult": 6,
            "startRound": 2
        },
        "numberOfRoundHistory": 100,
        "websocket": {
            "proxyPath": "",
            "route": "livepagegateway"
        },
        "mainObserverNamespace": "VipSeDie",
        "order": 2,
        "isSocketGateway": true
    }
}
```

### 2.2 Project Structure

Required directory structure:
```
src/games/saba-club/
└── vip-sedie/
    ├── bet-option/
    │   └── vip-sedie-bet-options.tsx
    ├── game-settings.ts
    ├── header.tsx
    ├── index.ts
    └── page.tsx
```

### 2.3 Asset Requirements

Required image assets:
```
public/static/images/
├── game-icons/
│   ├── sedie.png
│   └── vip-sedie.png
└── lobby/
    ├── active-bg.png
    ├── arrow.png
    └── inactive-bg.png
```

